@model ProfileViewModel
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "My profile"; var isParticipant = Model.Role == "Participant"; }
<h1 class="rd-title">My profile</h1>
<div class="row g-4">
    @if (isParticipant)
    {
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card rd-card p-4 text-center">
                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(Model.ProfilePictureUrl))
                {
                    <img src="@Fmt.ImageUrl(Model.ProfilePictureUrl)" class="rd-avatar mx-auto mb-3" alt="Your profile picture" />
                }
                else
                {
                    <div class="rd-avatar rd-avatar-empty mx-auto mb-3">👤</div>
                }
                <form asp-action="ProfilePicture" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data">
                    <input type="file" name="picture" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" class="form-control mb-2" required />
                    <button class="btn btn-outline-rd w-100" type="submit">Upload picture</button>
                    <div class="form-text">JPG, PNG or WebP, up to 5 MB.</div>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
    }
    <div class="@(isParticipant ? "col-md-8" : "col-md-8 offset-md-2")">
        <div class="card rd-card p-4">
            <form asp-action="Profile" method="post" novalidate>
                <div asp-validation-summary="ModelOnly" class="text-danger mb-2"></div>
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label class="form-label">Email</label>
                    <input class="form-control" value="@Model.Email" disabled />
                </div>
                @if (isParticipant)
                {
                    <div class="row g-3">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label asp-for="FirstName" class="form-label"></label>
                            <input asp-for="FirstName" class="form-control" />
                            <span asp-validation-for="FirstName" class="text-danger small"></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label asp-for="LastName" class="form-label"></label>
                            <input asp-for="LastName" class="form-control" />
                            <span asp-validation-for="LastName" class="text-danger small"></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label asp-for="DateOfBirth" class="form-label"></label>
                            <input asp-for="DateOfBirth" type="date" class="form-control" />
                            <span asp-validation-for="DateOfBirth" class="text-danger small"></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label asp-for="PhoneNumber" class="form-label"></label>
                            <input asp-for="PhoneNumber" class="form-control" />
                            <span asp-validation-for="PhoneNumber" class="text-danger small"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                }
                else
                {
                    <div class="row g-3">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label asp-for="OrganisationName" class="form-label"></label>
                            <input asp-for="OrganisationName" class="form-control" />
                            <span asp-validation-for="OrganisationName" class="text-danger small"></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label asp-for="ContactNumber" class="form-label"></label>
                            <input asp-for="ContactNumber" class="form-control" />
                            <span asp-validation-for="ContactNumber" class="text-danger small"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                }
                <button class="btn btn-rd mt-4" type="submit">Save changes</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
